From 1c0b45017d8613aaa39df90582d73620d99e2345 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 08:17:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] version: Reaper_v1.2.3 (ring revert, shell scrollbar, VPN +
 Network Analysis theme, QoS classful editor)

- www/reaper/reaper_content.css: revert USB ring to stock white_04 (drop the
  white_05 swap + geometry/blend block; owner reported no on-metal change from
  the v1.2.2 ring fix). + section 20: VPN Server wrapper/SPA containers and the
  Network Analysis #svgContainer plot box (data-viz lines/gridlines untouched).
- www/reaper_shell.asp: #page_frame scrolling="no" + min-height + overflow:hidden
  so the framed page never shows a nested scrollbar (single outer scrollbar).
- www/sysdep/FUNCTION/VPNS_V2/Advanced_VPNServer_Content.asp: inject
  reaper_content.css into the nested vpns_iframe (/VPN/vpns.html SPA, RWD_UI
  classes already themed by section 17) + auto-grow it + scrolling=no.
- www/QoS_EZQoS.asp + shared/defaults.c: HW QoS Classful (qos_type 11) priority
  editor - reorder the 5 upload classes + edit each ceiling %; persist order+ceils
  to qos_orates (positional min-ceil) and labels to new UI-only nvram
  qos_class_names (CKN_STR256; engine ignores). Apply = restart_qos;restart_firewall.
- version.conf: EXTENDNO Reaper_v1.2.3.

conn_diag/dblog KEPT (verified no phone-home transport; AiMesh-coupled).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
